4182                             								;----------------------------------------------------------
4183                             								; BIT 0 = Input is Sync fm RX
4184                             								; BIT 1 = Output to DO 1 or Tmr Cnt'l PW mod
4185                             								; BIT 2 = Output to DO 2
4186                             								; BIT 3 = Output to DO 3
4187                             								;
4188                             								; BIT 4 = SSO
4189                             								; BIT 5 = SS1
4190                             								; SSO SS1 BAUD RATE
4191                             								; 1 0 8192
4192                             								; 0 1 1024
4193                             								; 1 1 256
